Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.81,0:00:03.02,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.74,0:00:08.66,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Good to see you, Cap!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.66,0:00:11.87,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Friede! \N Thanks for inviting us along today!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.87,0:00:13.53,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I can’t wait to do fieldwork!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.53,0:00:16.08,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I wonder what Pokémon we’ll find!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.54,0:00:19.83,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’re you doin’?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.83,0:00:21.42,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,E-Err... Umm...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.88,0:00:26.17,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,You’re the newbie I’ve been hearing about?{[You're] the new recruit from the rumors?} \N I’m Friede. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.34,0:00:30.01,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,N-N-N-Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.13,0:00:30.76,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,{\an8}O-Ohh!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.01,0:00:33.51,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m so happy to meet the founding leader \N and Pokémon Professor!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.51,0:00:37.98,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, {\i1}you’re{\i0} energetic! \N Just the sort of trainer for the Rising Voltteccers!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.31,0:00:40.35,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.35,0:00:43.90,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,So that’s your partner, Navi?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.90,0:00:46.23,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yep! This is Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.23,0:00:48.74,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,So, {\i1}you{\i0} can get nervous too, eh?{similar to 147 13:09, thrown back at Navi}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.74,0:00:50.53,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Little kids should shut it!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.20,0:00:53.07,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Navi’s been looking forward \N to meeting you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.07,0:00:54.24,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Don’t tell {\i1}him{\i}!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.74,0:00:56.66,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Well then, should we get going?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.66,0:00:59.33,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Oh, we don’t have a full group yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.33,0:01:00.00,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.37,0:01:04.21,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Didn’t I mention?{言ってなかったか？} \N Another professor is joining us today.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.21,0:01:05.00,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Friede!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.00,0:01:07.26,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Ooh! Let me introduce you!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.34,0:01:09.88,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,This is Professor Willow!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.34,0:01:13.22,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go{\i0} on a journey \N looking for Pokémon! {JP game quote ポケモンを探す旅へ GO！    It's time to GO!}
Comment: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:15.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:45.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.87,0:03:01.33,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Cap! That hat still looks good on you!{acknowledgement of Willow having seen a Caphat before (42)}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.79,0:03:03.87,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Professor Willow.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.87,0:03:06.75,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Yeah, glad to see \N you’re still hard at work.{slight twist on a set phrase, 'good to see you're well' / lit. 'above all it's good to see you're well', swapping kenkou 'well' for katsuyaku 'actively/successfully working/participating'}{JP Willow says katsuyaku/katsuyaku-buri a lot}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.75,0:03:09.25,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,So, you’re the Rising Voltteccers?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.67,0:03:13.88,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,I hear you’ve traveled the world \N and seen lots of different Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.88,0:03:17.01,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,I’m excited to have the chance \N to do research with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.01,0:03:22.27,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Professor Willow travels the world \N surveying Pokémon ecology and distribution.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.27,0:03:23.98,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Look! What’s that over there?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.98,0:03:25.56,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Ooh! That’s rare!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.56,0:03:26.69,Main,Friede Willow,0,0,0,,Research time!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.69,0:03:27.27,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.69,0:03:32.90,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I think Professor Willow and Friede \N might have a lot in common...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.11,0:03:39.24,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh? What’s this thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.74,0:03:42.24,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,A PokéStop.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.24,0:03:46.66,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,They’re installed around here \N to aid in the research of Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.66,0:03:48.00,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,For research?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.59,0:03:53.63,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Whoa! Something popped out!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.63,0:03:56.13,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Monster Balls, and berries too!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.72,0:03:59.01,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Mega-innerestin’! Lemme try!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.01,0:04:05.02,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,And that’s not all!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.02,0:04:10.06,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,If you use this Lure Module, \N nearby Pokémon will gather around.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.15,0:04:17.20,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wow, it’s true!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.70,0:04:24.08,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Go and research what Pokémon live here, \N especially in the vicinity of the PokéStops!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.58,0:04:30.21,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,A forested area, and... \N a beach further out, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.21,0:04:34.71,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Grab their attention with berries, \N toss balls, and catch them.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.71,0:04:37.34,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,I’ll look after the Pokémon you find!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.34,0:04:40.43,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Awright! \N Lessee who can catch the most!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.43,0:04:41.84,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi won’t lose!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.84,0:04:46.35,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,{\q2}Finding a variety of species \N will give us a picture of this area’s distribution.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.35,0:04:47.48,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.48,0:04:49.73,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Let the research begin!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.73,0:04:50.85,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.20,0:05:01.49,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,A Nonokurage, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.49,0:05:04.83,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You’re gonna be mine!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.74,0:05:07.75,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.75,0:05:11.17,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ult! You have to grab \N their attention with berries first!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.17,0:05:12.83,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,That’s a pain!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.83,0:05:15.17,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I don’t need nunna that...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.88,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Aim for the head.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.80,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Okay, Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.22,0:05:23.76,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,How come?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.76,0:05:27.22,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Your target is a living thing{being}! \N Don’t expect it to be easy.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.22,0:05:30.73,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I {\i1}know{\i0} that! One more time!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.73,0:05:31.73,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.73,0:05:34.40,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Aw man, I used ‘em all!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.40,0:05:37.23,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yamirami! \N Time to refill at a PokéStop!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.32,0:05:45.62,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’re you doin’?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.62,0:05:47.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,This PokéStop won’t turn!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.66,0:05:52.12,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What’s that?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.63,0:05:55.63,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,A Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.63,0:05:59.88,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,Kakuleon. Color Change Pokémon. \N Normal type.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.88,0:06:03.05,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,It changes its hue \N to blend into its surroundings.{Exact match to Ultra Sun, but similar to Omega Ruby Pokedex en try}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.05,0:06:05.89,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,The zigzag pattern on its belly \N remains unchanged.{Omega Ruby Pokedex}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.89,0:06:07.68,Main,Ult Navi,0,0,0,,Ooh...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.68,0:06:11.27,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Kakuleon often hide on PokéStops.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.27,0:06:13.60,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Innerestin’! Lemme—!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.60,0:06:14.90,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.27,0:06:17.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Just stay outta my way next time!{Don't interfere [with what I'm doing] again!}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.61,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.61,0:06:24.57,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.58,0:06:28.66,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.87,Main,Liko Dot,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.92,0:06:42.26,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,A Yareyutan, huh? \N That’s a big find.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.26,0:06:44.18,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It could be the boss of this area.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.18,0:06:46.97,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It won’t eat my berries.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.97,0:06:48.97,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,How about some Golden Zuri Berries?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.97,0:06:50.39,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.27,0:06:57.52,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.36,0:07:00.94,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,In that case!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.66,0:07:07.37,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,So close!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.37,0:07:08.24,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Loudbone!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.34,0:07:20.84,Main,Friede Willow,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.84,0:07:22.76,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Great teamwork!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.76,0:07:27.97,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I get it... Then maybe if I have Mega Yamirami \N deflect it with the gem...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.43,0:07:33.18,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.93,0:07:35.69,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,All right! Time to hit the beach?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.31,0:07:40.31,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Waaah!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.31,0:07:42.32,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What’s all {\i1}this?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.69,0:07:44.74,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s full of Shellder...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.74,0:07:47.70,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,It seems that there’s \N a mass outbreak of them...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.70,0:07:51.16,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I’ll get one this time. \N First, give it a Zuri Berry...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.75,0:07:55.87,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Awright!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.25,0:07:59.21,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Wha—?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.58,0:08:01.71,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.84,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.81,0:08:15.98,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It evolved?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.98,0:08:17.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.52,0:08:21.56,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Maybe all those Shellder \N are here to look for Yadon.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.36,0:08:27.86,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh! Metamon is evolving!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.07,0:08:32.24,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.37,0:08:35.33,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Now! Go!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.33,0:08:38.33,Main,Friede Willow,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.79,0:08:40.08,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.46,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Good going, Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.46,0:08:43.09,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.63,0:08:46.01,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I ain’t givin’ up yet!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.01,0:08:48.38,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon, let’s go look over there!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.10,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,An Umidigda!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.10,0:08:58.35,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,They’re a rare sight around here!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.24,0:09:15.24,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,That’s a nice rhythm! \N Let’s sing, Loudbone!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.25,0:09:26.46,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Now’s your chance, Liko!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.46,0:09:27.30,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.55,0:09:34.55,Main,Friede Willow,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.85,0:09:38.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.06,0:09:43.40,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What Pokémon is it this time...?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.40,0:09:44.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hyah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.15,0:09:44.65,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,Waah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.65,0:09:45.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.61,0:09:46.90,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m sorr—!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.99,0:09:53.20,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You wanna catch that Yayakoma?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.20,0:09:55.66,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,Yeah. \N So I’m waiting for a chance to—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.66,0:09:56.99,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,It spotted me!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.54,0:09:59.04,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,Hyah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.04,0:09:59.95,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.41,0:10:04.00,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,Aww... That was my chance \N to become a trainer...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.42,0:10:06.84,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So you don’t have any Pokémon yet...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.84,0:10:10.59,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ooh! Well then, Navi-senpai here \N has got a ton to teach ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.59,0:10:11.67,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,Like what?{"All sorts"?}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.67,0:10:14.13,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Like... lemme see...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.76,0:10:17.14,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,How to toss Monster Balls!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.14,0:10:19.14,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Just watch me...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.14,0:10:22.23,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hyah!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.86,0:10:31.69,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,You... You’re pretty funny!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.69,0:10:33.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,The name’s not “you,” it’s Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.49,0:10:35.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,This’s my partner, Metamon.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.12,0:10:38.91,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,I’m Gota{/Gouta}. I live in a town nearby.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.91,0:10:39.66,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Navi...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.91,0:10:43.66,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.66,0:10:48.00,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You, an aspiring Pokémon Trainer, \N wanna catch your first Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.71,0:10:50.96,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Awright! Then as your senpai, \N I’ve got a ton to teach—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.96,0:10:53.26,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ult, Navi did that already.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.26,0:10:54.05,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.05,0:10:57.80,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to \N catch a Yayakoma...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.51,0:11:01.72,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Don’t fret over it. \N A catch is a twist of fate{is a chance encounter}.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.72,0:11:05.44,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Your first Pokémon \N is bound to come to you!{Your First-Pokemon will certainly come to your place.}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.44,0:11:07.02,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.81,0:11:12.23,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,You never know when it might be, \N or if {\i1}this{\i0} one’s the one...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.86,0:11:16.28,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,But I’m sure your passion \N will get through to it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.87,0:11:30.67,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Thanks to all of you, \N I’m getting a good idea of the distribution here!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.67,0:11:34.92,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,It’s intriguing that this area is home \N to such a diverse mix of Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.92,0:11:39.76,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,{\q2}If I were to guess why, since this area’s the border between \N the forest and the sea, some Pokémon ecologies...{go-es on, can't hear anything clearly beyond seitaikei though}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.76,0:11:40.93,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.68,0:11:44.06,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Think Gota{/Gouta} managed to catch one?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.43,0:11:49.06,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I want him to meet the perfect partner, \N like how Navi met Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.98,0:11:53.36,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Master said it, right? \N A catch is a twist of fate!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.36,0:11:56.20,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Not worth fretting over. \N Right, Master?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.20,0:12:00.91,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Yeah. When the time comes, \N the Pokémon will find you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.03,0:12:04.04,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,So the same happened to you, Friede?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.04,0:12:07.08,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Back when I was smaller than all of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.12,0:12:10.88,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,A Pokémon Professor’s first Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.88,0:12:13.67,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Just how did you meet Lizardon?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.67,0:12:15.46,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I’m mega-curious!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.46,0:12:18.51,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,How we met... \N Well, that was...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.31,0:12:30.98,Main,Lucca,0,0,0,,Good morning, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.19,Main,Lucca,0,0,0,,Let’s make today another—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.19,0:12:34.27,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.65,0:12:37.28,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Friede! Late again?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.28,0:12:38.65,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,I made it, didn’t I?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.57,0:12:42.03,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,I’m safe{baseball}, right, Ms. Lucca?{sensei}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.78,0:12:45.66,Main,Lucca,0,0,0,,If you were running in the hall, \N you’re out.{baseball}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.12,0:12:46.95,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Ahh...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.55,0:12:58.01,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Great, right? This is my Caterpie! \N I caught it in the forest!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.01,0:13:01.93,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Well, my dad promised \N me he’d get me a Guardie!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.93,0:13:05.43,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Seriously?! \N I wanna get my own Pokémon soon, too...{I want to have a Pokemon quickly, too...}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.43,0:13:08.27,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Look at this! \N I put a ribbon on my Purin!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.27,0:13:11.19,Main,Students,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.19,0:13:16.36,Main,Student,0,0,0,,{\q2}Oh right, did you hear? \N They say someone in the next class caught a Pikachu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.07,0:13:20.65,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,By my calculations, \N it should’ve worked...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.57,0:13:23.87,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Practicing again this morning? {So you were training in the morning again today?}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.45,0:13:25.95,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Whatcha want, Orio?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.33,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,You were late.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.33,0:13:29.16,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,I said I was safe{baseball}.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.16,0:13:32.33,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,I’m so close to getting this to work!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.33,0:13:34.08,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Always with that...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.08,0:13:36.42,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Is making airplanes \N really that much fun?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.42,0:13:40.09,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Yeah! Thinking about being able to fly \N gets me so psyched!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.09,0:13:42.63,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Orio! You should try it too!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.63,0:13:44.93,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Eh... If I feel like it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.10,0:13:49.48,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,More importantly, Friede... \N Have you picked your first Pokémon?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.48,0:13:50.43,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Not interested.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.43,0:13:52.31,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,You don’t want to be a trainer?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.85,0:13:55.31,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Not when my dream’s to be a pilot!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.31,0:13:59.15,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Soon as I can, {\i1}bam!{\i0} \N I wanna be flying!{I want to fly like bang/bam/wham! through the sky quick!}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.15,0:14:00.53,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,That’s it!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.99,0:14:04.57,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,If I make the wings {\i1}this{\i0} size, \N the air resistance will...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.45,0:14:11.04,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Back then, I was always on my own, \N devoted to my dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.35,0:14:32.60,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,I was sure that was gonna work...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.60,0:14:35.77,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,I’m not giving up! \N I’ll find a way to fly!
Comment: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:49.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.88,0:14:59.00,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.35,0:15:13.73,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,All right! A new record!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.73,0:15:14.35,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.10,0:15:19.69,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Did you see that? I was flying!{Were you watching? The part where I flew!}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.48,0:15:22.57,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Cool, huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.57,0:15:25.61,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Although, well... \N I only flew for a little...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.61,0:15:26.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.07,0:15:29.32,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.58,0:15:31.66,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Waah!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.95,0:15:34.75,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,My goggles!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.75,0:15:36.62,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.75,0:15:43.26,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Where did that guy go?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.67,0:15:46.88,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Not it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.39,0:15:52.26,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,You can fly... \N That makes you my senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.18,0:15:54.56,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Ah, just you...? 
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.27,0:15:59.02,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Sure is gutsy for such a little guy. 
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.90,0:16:02.02,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,So this is where they live...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.02,0:16:04.03,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,I live so close by to them,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.03,0:16:06.03,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,but I don’t know a thing about them.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.03,0:16:08.45,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,So there’s all kinds of \N different Pokémon...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.57,0:16:11.53,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Right, the one with my goggles!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.04,0:16:18.37,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Found you!{Fred line}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.98,0:16:37.60,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,You okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.87,0:16:57.12,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,That guy... \N It’s copying me.{Dread Lizardon}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.10,0:17:24.06,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,You’ve got an eye \N for the sky too, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.23,0:17:27.15,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,But those goggles...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.15,0:17:29.53,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,My dad bought them for me.{they're something I had my dad buy for me.}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.03,0:17:37.29,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Let’s fly together!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.29,0:17:42.04,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,I wanna fly too! \N We’ve both got the same dream!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.08,0:17:46.30,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Let’s head for the sky together!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.93,0:18:04.44,Main,Lucca,0,0,0,,Ooh, so you made friends \N with a Hitokage.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.44,0:18:06.69,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,So it’s called a Hitokage?{Dread Lizardon}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.23,0:18:09.32,Main,Lucca,0,0,0,,You didn’t even know its name?{Dread Lizardon}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.32,0:18:12.57,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,I don’t know much about Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.57,0:18:13.95,Main,Lucca,0,0,0,,You can start now.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.95,0:18:17.45,Main,Lucca,0,0,0,,Being with them is what \N allows your world to expand.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.45,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,My world...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.37,0:18:25.42,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Let’s be great friends, Hitokage!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.22,0:18:37.93,Main,Lucca,0,0,0,,Congrats on the catch, Friede-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.27,0:18:45.23,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,I caught Hitokage, \N and that{the event of catching} expanded my world.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.94,0:18:50.19,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,We headed to all kinds of different places{various places}, \N and met all kinds of different Pokémon{many Pokemon}.{neither matches Navi's allsorts}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.53,0:18:54.99,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,I became devoted to Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.24,0:18:59.99,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,My partner immersed me \N in their world.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.91,0:19:03.00,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Hitokage evolved...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.00,0:19:04.71,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,...and grew...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.25,0:19:08.67,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,...until finally, \N we got to fly together!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.67,0:19:10.50,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.93,0:19:27.56,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Somewhere along the line, \N I set my sights on being a Pokémon Professor.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.31,0:19:30.32,Main,Professor,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.32,0:19:31.90,Main,Professor,0,0,0,,We expect good things from you!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.90,0:19:33.28,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.28,0:19:39.24,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Which is how I ended up stepping out \N into a world of adventures with Lizardon.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.33,0:19:44.25,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,So that’s how the two of you met!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.25,0:19:45.96,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Lovely!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.96,0:19:48.13,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.13,0:19:50.42,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,There’s still one area \N we haven’t surveyed!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.42,0:19:52.75,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Let’s head off to research it quick!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.75,0:19:53.38,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.92,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I was thinking it was about time \N to make dinner...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.92,0:19:59.64,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Well then, how about we work up \N a bit more appetite before sundown?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.43,0:20:02.39,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I can’t quit now!{I can't allow myself to be outdone!}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.22,0:20:06.89,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Awright! I’m mega-fired up!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.36,0:20:12.69,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.69,0:20:15.36,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,You really put in some good \N surveying work yesterday!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.36,0:20:17.32,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,All of you, thank you! \N Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.32,0:20:19.70,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And thank {\i1}you{\i0} very much, too!{We're the ones who should be saying, "Thank you very much!"}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.70,0:20:21.24,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It was mega-fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.24,0:20:22.87,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Please invite us along again!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.87,0:20:24.08,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.66,0:20:26.66,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Go—!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.92,0:20:30.00,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.44,0:20:55.44,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.44,0:20:57.65,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Gota{/Gouta}, congrats!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.65,0:21:00.45,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,Navi! Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.87,0:21:06.08,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.54,0:21:09.16,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Now you, too, are a Pokémon Trainer!{not a game line}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.16,0:21:11.83,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Incredible adventures await you!{not a game line}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.58,0:21:13.54,Main,Gota,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.26,0:21:21.05,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See you, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.05,0:21:23.22,Main,Willow,0,0,0,,Until we meet again!{ENgame has 'Until again' as a catchphrase for Willow, but translated to slightly different JP and not kept consistent, and ENgame Willow seems to be written a bumbling fool who can't remember greetings anyway, though JPgame Willow doesn't get that trait}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.22,0:21:25.72,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.56,0:21:29.64,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,They said they were heading right off \N to do some new research. {TL: They said they were heading straight off to their next research...}{bit loose, but "their next research" is sorta NG. hopefully this is good enough. We could also do simply "to do some more research." but that's vaguer and might imply they're going to do more of the SAME research. -ed}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.64,0:21:31.73,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That’s some stamina...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.73,0:21:33.86,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,They’re always so devoted.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.86,0:21:35.61,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So’re all of us, right?!{Same for Navi and co, right?!}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.61,0:21:37.86,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Let’s go see some new Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.86,0:21:39.57,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.61,0:21:44.66,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1850)}Wait for us!
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.74,0:21:48.29,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.29,0:21:51.87,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.25,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Hitokage!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.25,0:21:58.21,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The flame on its tail \N is a display of its life force.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.21,0:22:02.26,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Something can be discerned via this flame, \N but do you know what it is?{yomitoru can be read/foretell, and B/C lean into that, though the options seem odd in EN. Leaving out 'The' seems odd on B/C, but conversely adding 'Its' to A would make the answer obvious so bleh}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.09,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.36,0:23:42.28,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.28,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.70,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,A: Feelings!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:46.03,0:23:48.70,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The flame on its tail \N displays its feelings.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:48.70,0:23:51.45,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,When it’s emotional, \N it blazes up fiercely!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.45,0:23:53.20,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,That was a great Ember, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.20,0:23:56.71,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Let’s train some more, \N and make sure we win next time!
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.38,0:24:03.76,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It’s a festival!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.76,0:24:07.55,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m gonna wear a cute jinbei, \N and do lots of ring tossing and yo-yo fishing!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.55,0:24:10.55,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Oh, and eat candy apples too!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.55,0:24:13.39,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,So, this is your first \N Kitakami hamlet festival, Navi?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:13.39,0:24:14.47,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I bet you can’t wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.47,0:24:15.43,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:15.43,0:24:17.39,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that a kid from the village?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.39,0:24:20.27,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hi! Wanna come with us?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.27,0:24:23.82,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.82,0:24:26.07,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Navi and the Mysterious Masked Child
Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.07,0:24:28.45,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wait, “Masked Child”?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:18.60,OP,,0,0,0,,{=62}{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}Ready, set, and... GO! READY! GO!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:21.31,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}We’re in top-notch mode
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.31,0:01:24.27,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}You’re not alone, you know?
